{"body":"<!-- pr-preamble:start -->\n<!-- meta:issue:3470 -->\n> **Source:** Issue #3470\n\nCloses #3470\n\n<!-- pr-preamble:end -->\n\n<!-- auto-status-summary:start -->\n## Automated Status Summary\n#### Scope\nThe active sync campaign has matching review findings in Doc-Lineage#33, Manager-Database#1684 and learning-management-system#678: auto dispatch can reserve only in fallback storage during a primary outage, while completion accepts only a primary reservation. Such work cannot reach a recorded terminal state.\n\n<!-- Updated WORKFLOW_OUTPUTS.md context:start -->\n## Context for Agent\n\n### Related Issues/PRs\n- [stranske/Doc-Lineage#33](https://github.com/stranske/Doc-Lineage/issues/33)\n- [stranske/Manager-Database#1684](https://github.com/stranske/Manager-Database/issues/1684)\n- [stranske/learning-management-system#678](https://github.com/stranske/learning-management-system/issues/678)\n- [#1836](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/issues/1836)\n<!-- Updated WORKFLOW_OUTPUTS.md context:end -->\n\n#### Tasks\n- [ ] Require a successful primary read and reservation write before automatic dispatch.\n- [ ] Preserve legacy fallback debounce records and migrate eligible retries to primary.\n- [ ] Preserve completion attempt fencing and explicit single-store compatibility.\n- [ ] Cover storage outage/recovery, reused adapters, ambiguous writes and CLI refusal output; document the contract.\n- [ ] Deliver reviewed source through Maint 68 and Maint 71 with exact-head evidence.\n\n#### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Primary outage never starts a fallback-only run.\n- [ ] Healthy storage permits same-head recovery without manual state deletion.\n- [ ] Existing pending fallback work is not duplicated before its stale timeout.\n- [ ] Runner tests, lint, types and template validation pass.\n- [ ] Source reviewed/merged and affected generated deliveries reconciled by Maint 71.\n\n- [ ] Consumer findings: https://github.com/stranske/Doc-Lineage/pull/33#discussion_r4033676701 ; https://github.com/stranske/Manager-Database/pull/1684#discussion_r4033675967 ; https://github.com/stranske/learning-management-system/pull/678#discussion_r4033665894 .\n\n**Head SHA:** 9a89cc2b9e08cd433eca900c55b68661f02fe5a3\n**Latest Runs:** ✅ success — Gate\n**Required:** gate: ✅ success\n\n| Workflow / Job | Result | Logs |\n|----------------|--------|------|\n| Gate | ✅ success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/35442989953) |\n| Health 40 Sweep | ✅ success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/35442989911) |\n| Health 44 Gate Branch Protection | ❔ in progress | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/35442989738) |\n| Health 45 Agents Guard | ✅ success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/35442989747) |\n| Health 50 Security Scan | ✅ success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/35442989748) |\n| Health 52 Semgrep Scan | ✅ success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/35442989754) |\n| Health 74 Template Drift | ✅ success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/35442987820) |\n| Maint 52 Validate Workflows | ✅ success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/35442989730) |\n| PR 11 - Minimal invariant CI | ✅ success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/35442989729) |\n| PR 46 Dependency Repair Contract | ⏭️ skipped | Last completed result; current run in PR checks |\n| Selftest CI | ✅ success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/35442989740) |\n<!-- auto-status-summary:end -->","closingIssuesReferences":[{"id":"I_kwDOQprj9M8AAAABSGNcQA","number":3470,"repository":{"id":"R_kgDOQprj9A","name":"Workflows","owner":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDQ2MzIy","login":"stranske"}},"url":"https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/issues/3470"}],"labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDOQprj9M8AAAACUeB71A","name":"verify:compare","description":"C